note """analysis check: dead nodes. No send targets `stranded`, and a loop carries no from-clause, so nothing can ever enter it and the three statements below it can never execute. This is the shape the canonical toy.flow carried before its repair; no canonical fixture has it any more, which is why it lives here."""
flow orders
import "github.com/acme/billing"
import "acme.dev/flows/audit"
source ingest Poll
sink done audit.Store from ingest
loop stranded
transform lonely billing.Charge from stranded
sink out audit.Store from lonely
